# Migration to ZimaOS (casatozima)

- [ ] Create the new project directory `casatozima`
- [ ] Copy essential files from `flask-app` (Dockerfile, compose, src, requirements)
- [ ] Create a clean `.gitignore` file
- [ ] Initialize a new Git repository in `casatozima`
- [ ] Add a migration guide/README to the new repository
- [ ] (Optional) Create the repository on GitHub using MCP if requested
- [ ] Finalize the "clean" state for ZimaOS deployment
